---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact BitEvo | Scope & Audit Intake" description="Contact BitEvo through the published commercial email, bounded audit intake or existing triage scheduling. Public intake does not authorize testing." alternates={{ en: '/contact', ru: '/ru/contact' }}>
  <section class="section"><div class="narrow">
    <div class="eyebrow">Contact · BitEvo</div>
    <h1 class="display">Contact for a bounded scope discussion</h1>
    <p class="lede">Use an existing channel to discuss one agreed workflow, its owner decision and the evidence you need. A public inquiry is not authorization to test a system.</p>
    <div class="panel">
      <h2>Commercial email</h2>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="mailto:robert@bitevo.work">robert@bitevo.work</a></p>
      <h2>Prepare an intake brief</h2>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/audit-intake">Audit intake</a> prepares scope information before any written agreement. Do not include passwords, tokens, production credentials or unnecessary customer data.</p>
      <h2>Schedule a triage</h2>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="https://cal.com/robert-dumanyan-vlck0x/free-20-minute-triage">Existing 20-minute Cal.com triage</a>.</p>
      <p>Review the published <a class="text-link" href="/entry-audit">Entry Audit boundaries</a> and <a class="text-link" href="/pricing">pricing</a> before proposing a paid scope.</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
